{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"3b73bf77938ef42f","name":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/CovertOp/units/card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"92nd NAVAL BRIGADE","text":"Reveal: Lose 3 kredits at the start of your next turn.","flavorText":"When Germany invaded the Soviet Union, several Red Army naval infantry brigades were formed. These units were not similar to marines in other navies but served mainly as ship crews gathered for shore combat duties or as landing parties. The 92nd Naval Brigade (Brigada Morskoi Pekhoty) was formed from the Volga Flotilla in September 1942. Its two battalions were rushed to the defense of Stalingrad, charged with holding the Grain Elevator south of the Mamayev Kurgan in the face of heavy attacks. The Brigade was disbanded once the city was recaptured.","faction":"Soviet","type":"infantry","rarity":"Common","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":5,"defense":4},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade_title","SourceString":"92nd NAVAL BRIGADE","LocalizedString":"92nd NAVAL BRIGADE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":5,"defense":4,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade_text","SourceString":"Reveal: Lose 3 kredits at the start of your next turn.","LocalizedString":"Reveal: Lose 3 kredits at the start of your next turn."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade_history","SourceString":"When Germany invaded the Soviet Union, several Red Army naval infantry brigades were formed. These units were not similar to marines in other navies but served mainly as ship crews gathered for shore combat duties or as landing parties. The 92nd Naval Brigade (Brigada Morskoi Pekhoty) was formed from the Volga Flotilla in September 1942. Its two battalions were rushed to the defense of Stalingrad, charged with holding the Grain Elevator south of the Mamayev Kurgan in the face of heavy attacks. The Brigade was disbanded once the city was recaptured.","LocalizedString":"When Germany invaded the Soviet Union, several Red Army naval infantry brigades were formed. These units were not similar to marines in other navies but served mainly as ship crews gathered for shore combat duties or as landing parties. The 92nd Naval Brigade (Brigada Morskoi Pekhoty) was formed from the Volga Flotilla in September 1942. Its two battalions were rushed to the defense of Stalingrad, charged with holding the Grain Elevator south of the Mamayev Kurgan in the face of heavy attacks. The Brigade was disbanded once the city was recaptured."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"draftBaseWeight":0.9,"suppressionExceptionTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"hasAmbush":true,"hasCovert":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_soviet_naval_inf_summer24.t_soviet_naval_inf_summer24","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Soviet WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/92nd_NAVAL_BRIGADE.92nd_NAVAL_BRIGADE","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":341.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_92nd_naval_brigade_photo","SourceString":"Soviet naval infantry, 1942. ","LocalizedString":"Soviet naval infantry, 1942. "},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryL'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryL.47"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeHeavy_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeHeavy.0"},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Ef